32aa8a169dd58a8930ee891ff7b1758\",\n      \"duration_s\": 0.014,\n      \"exit_code\": 0\n    }\n  },\n  \"evidence\": [\n    \"work/netlist/design.xml\",\n    \"work/netlist/connectivity.json\",\n    \"work/rc-step/execution.json\",\n    \"work/rc-step/console.log\",\n    \"work/rc-step/deck.cir\",\n    \"work/rc-step/control.sp\",\n    \"work/rc-step/ngspice.log\",\n    \"work/rc-step/result.raw\"\n  ],\n  \"execution\": \"ok\",\n  \"id\": \"rc-step\",\n  \"kind\": \"rc_transient\",\n  \"limitations\": [\n    \"ideal unloaded step response from populated R/C/L values only; tolerance, temperature, loading and hardware behavior are untested\",\n    \"connectors/power flags carried no element and were excluded: J1\"\n  ],\n  \"outcome\": \"pass\",\n  \"summary\": \"transient response meets all declared measurement limits\"\n}\n* agent-ee rc_transient deck, generated from the native XML netlist\nC1 OUT 0 100n\nR1 IN OUT 10k\nVSTEP IN 0 PWL(0 0 1n 1)\n.tran 0.005m 5m\n.meas tran vout_1ms FIND v(OUT) AT=1m\n.meas tran vout_5ms FIND v(OUT) AT=5m\n.end\n* agent-ee generated ngspice control script\n.control\nset num_threads=1\nset noaskquit\nsource /work/deck.cir\nrun\nwrite /work/result.raw\nquit\n.endc\n.end\n\nNote: No compatibility mode selected!\n\n\nCircuit: * agent-ee generated ngspice control script\n\n\nNote: No compatibility mode selected!\n\n\nCircuit: * agent-ee rc_transient deck, generated from the native xml netlist\n\nDoing analysis at TEMP = 27.000000 and TNOM = 27.000000\n\nUsing SPARSE 1.3 as Direct Linear Solver\n\nInitial Transient Solution\n--------------------------\n\nNode                                   Voltage\n----                                   -------\nout                                          0\nin                                           0\nvstep#branch                                 0\n\n\nNo. of Data Rows : 1025\n\n  Measurements for Transient Analysis\n\nvout_1ms            =  6.321201e-01\nvout_5ms            =  9.932621e-01\n\nb