{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_4","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc 'cat /candidate/requirements/fixture-requirements.md /candidate/project/rc_filter.kicad_pro /candidate/project/sym-lib-table /candidate/project/fp-lib-table'","aggregated_output":"# Declared fixture requirements (RC low-pass review exercise)\n\nThese are artificial review requirements declared for this demonstration\nfixture. They are not ECU electrical requirements, and they are fixed for the\nwhole demonstration (recorded before any review run).\n\n1. Step response: with an ideal 1 V step at /IN and no external load, the\n   voltage at /OUT at t = 1 ms after the step must satisfy\n   0.62 V <= V(/OUT, 1 ms) <= 0.65 V.\n   (Intended design: R1 = 10 kohm, C1 = 100 nF, tau = 1 ms,\n   V(1 ms) = 1 - exp(-1) = 0.6321 V.)\n2. Geometry: every copper track segment on the board must be at least\n   0.20 mm wide. This is a declared geometric requirement for the exercise,\n   not an ampacity or manufacturing guarantee.\n\nScope limits: the ideal R/C simulation establishes only the unloaded step\nresponse. Tolerance, temperature, loading, ADC sampling, EMI and hardware\nbehavior are untested by this fixture.\n{\n  \"board\": {\n    \"design_settings\": {\n      \"defaults\": {},\n      \"diff_pair_dimensions\": [],\n      \"drc_exclusions\": [],\n      \"rules\": {},\n      \"track_widths\": [],\n      \"via_dimensions\": []\n    }\n  },\n  \"boards\": [],\n  \"libraries\": {\n    \"pinned_footprint_libs\": [],\n    \"pinned_symbol_libs\": []\n  },\n  \"meta\": {\n    \"filename\": \"rc_filter.kicad_pro\",\n    \"version\": 1\n  },\n  \"net_settings\": {\n    \"classes\": [],\n    \"meta\": {\n      \"version\": 0\n    }\n  },\n  \"pcbnew\": {\n    \"page_layout_descr_file\": \"\"\n  },\n  \"sheets\": [\n    [\n      \"dc99dc4f-7c27-5bb7-bd88-7cf6f3eb0fcb\",\n      \"Root\"\n    ]\n  ],\n  \"text_variables\": {},\n  \"schematic\": {\n    \"top_level_sheets\": [\n      {\n        \"filename\": \"rc_filter.kicad_sch\",\n        \"name\": \"rc_filter\",\n        \"uuid\": \"dc99dc4f-7c27-5bb7-bd88-7cf6f3eb0fcb\"\n      }\n    ]\n  }\n}\n(sym_lib_table\n  (version 7)\n  (lib (name \"Connector_Generic\")(type \"KiCad\")(uri \"${KICAD10_SYMBOL_DIR}/Connector_Generic.kicad_sym\")(options \"\")(descr \"\"))\n  (lib (name \"Device\")(type \"KiCad\")(uri \"${KICAD10_SYMBOL_DIR}/Device.kicad_sym\")(options \"\")(descr \"\"))\n  (lib (name \"power\")(type \"KiCad\")(uri \"${KICAD10_SYMBOL_DIR}/power.kicad_sym\")(options \"\")(descr \"\"))\n)\n(fp_lib_table\n  (version 7)\n  (lib (name \"Capacitor_SMD\")(type \"KiCad\")(uri \"${KICAD10_FOOTPRINT_DIR}/Capacitor_SMD.pretty\")(options \"\")(descr \"\"))\n  (lib (name \"Connector_PinHeader_2.54mm\")(type \"KiCad\")(uri \"${KICAD10_FOOTPRINT_DIR}/Connector_PinHeader_2.54mm.pretty\")(options \"\")(descr \"\"))\n  (lib (name \"Resistor_SMD\")(type \"KiCad\")(uri \"${KICAD10_FOOTPRINT_DIR}/Resistor_SMD.pretty\")(options \"\")(descr \"\"))\n)\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
